==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[theoretick]] {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{term|theōrēticus|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|θεωρητικός|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌθiːəˈɹɛtɪk/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Concerned with [[theories]] or [[hypotheses]] rather than with [[practical]] matters.
# Existing only in [[theory]], not proven in [[reality]].

====Related terms====
* [[theoretical]]

